Source
------
Blender 5.2.2, release/datafiles/colormanagement/luts/ (AgX_*, luminance_compensation_bt2020.cube) and
release/datafiles/colormanagement/filmic/ (filmic_*), at blender/blender tag v5.2.2.
The bytes were copied from the Blender 5.2.2 application bundle
(Contents/Resources/5.2/datafiles/colormanagement/). The GitHub file reader refuses files over
1 MB, so the tag itself was not byte-compared.

