OpenColorIO
-----------
../ocio.rs re-implements the allocation, LUT interpolation, LUT inversion (FindLutInv), the
GradingPrimary, GradingTone and CDL arithmetic, and the matrix composition of OpenColorIO 2.5.0 (the
version bundled with Blender 5.2.2), following the source of AcademySoftwareFoundation/OpenColorIO v2.5.0.
That source is licensed under BSD-3-Clause, Copyright Contributors to the OpenColorIO Project
(for example, the SPDX header of src/OpenColorIO/ops/allocation/AllocationOp.cpp).
